    narr:narration """This hub tracks the evolution of the [core decision capture feature](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), initially defined in March 2026 as the product's primary differentiator. By August 2026, the narrative shifts from conceptual definition to empirical validation through the [Sprint 4 delivery outcomes](narr:Position_Sprint4OutcomeAndDriver). The recent trajectory centers on the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_1), which is framed as a [key unlock](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_3) for team performance. The data points to a [record-high velocity](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_2) for the period, grounding the abstract goal of consensus-based capture in concrete technical milestones and quantitative team output.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785578557516_1> ;
